{
  "name": "YouTube transcripts to Google Sheets with Importly",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## YouTube transcripts into Google Sheets\nAdd video links to a sheet; this fills in the title, transcript and language for every row that doesn't have one yet. Uses the video's captions ($0.003 each), or speech-to-text for videos without captions if you turn it on.\n\n### Setup\n1. Get an Importly API key at https://www.importly.io/dashboard/api-key?utm_source=n8n&utm_medium=template&utm_campaign=guerrilla-2026-11 (free to try, no card required).\n2. In the **Importly** node, create an **Importly API** credential and paste the key.\n3. Make a Google Sheet with the columns `url`, `title`, `language`, `transcript`.\n4. Pick that sheet in **Read video links** and **Write transcript to sheet**.\n\nPrefer Notion? Swap the last node for **Notion > Create database page** and map the same fields.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "ec61ff68-c94b-4857-96c7-98b9c45bd50d",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Videos without captions\nIn **Get transcript** > Options, set **Source** to **Importly Speech-to-Text** ($0.01 per minute). Add **Max Cost (USD)** to cap long videos.\n\nGoogle Sheets cells hold 50,000 characters, so very long transcripts are cut to fit.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "be1374bc-d961-49da-8bb7-7e6c8eb4c2ae",
      "name": "No captions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        680,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 7
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "4ebd5b54-daab-4c94-ba86-4b97441ffd29",
      "name": "Every day",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "75cd601e-23f3-4115-bf63-126b51886295",
      "name": "Read video links",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        220,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "a0a7e138-d0a9-41e7-beae-953b7080fd50",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.url }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "d8b24cf8-880f-4844-9264-81187d06441a",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.transcript }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "empty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
